# Generated ORAtlas interoperability artifacts.
#
# These are a deterministic function of the source, rebuilt by
# `oratlas-myst export`, and are published from the built site rather than from
# the repository. A publication that prefers to review them in diffs can commit
# them instead: `oratlas-myst validate` then catches any drift from source.
